BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Blooming Neighborhoods Celebration (Presented by City of Bloomingt
 on\, IN - Housing and Neighborhood Development - HAND)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261017T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261017T120000
UID:89a77451dbe9bd387b8b445fb1d5a4f1@wfhb.org
DESCRIPTION:Under this year’s theme\, “Many Neighborhoods\, One Bloomi
 ngton\,” we are bringing community members and local groups together to 
 share accomplishments\, network\, and celebrate what makes our city a grea
 t place to live. Here is what you can look forward to during the event: Me
 et & Mingle tables featuring local community partner organizations. Intera
 ctive group activities for all ages. A first-hand look at the resources av
 ailable inside HAND’s Front Porch trailer. A community photo booth. A bi
 g commemorative group photo. This event is completely free and open to the
  public. Neighborhood residents\, families\, and community supporters are 
 all encouraged to drop by!
LOCATION:Outside City Hall\, 401 N Morton St\, Bloomington
URL:https://wfhb.org/events/blooming-neighborhoods-celebration-presented-b
 y-city-of-bloomington-in-housing-and-neighborhood-development-hand/
X-SOURCE:WFHB Community Calendar
END:VEVENT
