UID:be283175993b7de8469d38f5e6a200d4@wfhb.org
DESCRIPTION:This community gathering will feature speakers\, music\, and m
 ultiple tables with information from community organizations\, all focused
  on encouraging early voting in the midterm elections. The rally will incl
 ude a contest for the best sign with a get-out-the-vote message. (Note: Mo
 nroe County early voting is NOT open on October 17.) Please follow us on s
 ocial media to see flyers detailing the event and actions leading up to it
 : Follow us on Facebook at https://www.facebook.com/ people/District-9-Ind
 iana- 50501/61581594964508/ Follow us on Instagram at https://www.instagra
 m.com/ district_9_indiana_50501/ Organized by District 9 Indiana / Bloomin
 gton 50501 The Mobilize event page is at https://www.mobilize.us/ mobilize
 /event/1040838/
