BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Traveling University presents: Live Free AND Die: Growing Health D
 isparities Between Voters in "Red" Counties and "Blue Counties"
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261018T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261018T170000
UID:628b57c5c1e5385565aee1a4fd1f695c@wfhb.org
DESCRIPTION:In this presentation\, Tim Londergan and Steve Vigdor\, will d
 emonstrate significant and growing differences in life expectancy and the 
 prevalence of chronic diseases between these regions. They will examine ho
 w differences in educational attainment and access to quality healthcare\,
  as well as current federal and state health policies\, exacerbate these d
 isparities. They will end by discussing potential policy shifts that could
  help close the gap and improve health outcomes across the political spect
 rum.
LOCATION:Meeting Room 1B/1C Combo\, Monroe County Publc Library\, 303 E. K
 irkwood Ave.\, Bloomington
URL:https://wfhb.org/events/live-free-and-die-growing-health-disparities-b
 etween-voters-in-red-counties-and-blue-counties/
X-SOURCE:WFHB Community Calendar
END:VEVENT
