BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Larks\, Loons\, and Lorikeets: An Ornithology Pop-Up Exhibition
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261020T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261020T160000
UID:796f513bd37d7b3c1aad4323063531ed@wfhb.org
DESCRIPTION:https://events.iu.edu/libraries/event/birds-in-books Presented
  in partnership with the Sassafras Audubon Society. Visitors can page thro
 ugh the Lilly Library’s dazzling collection of ornithology materials\, i
 ncluding the Double Elephant Folio edition of John James Audubon’s Birds
  of America\, and learn how to get more involved in local bird conservatio
 n efforts. Indiana University’s own Audubon expert\, Dr. Christoph Irmsc
 her\, will be present to talk about his research and writings on Audubon a
