SUMMARY:Wire Wrapped Wonders - Kyanite Broom Pendant with Poesis Payne
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261030T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261030T203000
UID:d1da8c054450c4675e0334e82d282454@wfhb.org
DESCRIPTION:In this hands-on workshop\, you’ll learn the art of wire wra
 pping while creating your very own kyanite crystal broom . Kyanite is a be
 autiful stone often associated with balance\, alignment\, calming energy\,
  and clearing energetic blockages . It’s traditionally believed to help 
 promote a sense of tranquility and strengthen meditation and intuition. No
  previous wire-wrapping experience is needed. Just bring yourself\, your c
 uriosity\, and your inner witch. All materials are provided.
LOCATION:Gather\, 116 N Walnut Street\,  Bloomington\, IN
URL:https://wfhb.org/events/wire-wrapped-wonders-kyanite-broom-pendant-wit
 h-poesis-payne/
