BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Media School Workshops for Teens
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261114T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261114T160000
UID:7518973feecae3a39fedb0ffd9a82b3e@wfhb.org
DESCRIPTION:These weekend workshops for students ages 13-18 provide an int
 roduction to careers in Cinema\, Game Dev\, and Journalism. Try out media 
 production\, create a mini-project\, and experience the IU campus. No prio
